---

# 🧠 Important Troubleshooting Example

Suppose:

```text
ping 8.8.8.8
       ↓
Works

ping google.com
       ↓
Fails
```

This suggests basic IP connectivity is working but DNS resolution may be the problem.

Next steps could include:

```text
ipconfig /all
        ↓
Check DNS configuration
        ↓
nslookup google.com
        ↓
Investigate DNS
        ↓
Correct authorized DNS configuration
        ↓
Test again
```

