# 🔐 Active Directory Revision

## Authentication

Authentication answers:

> **Who are you?**

Example:

A user enters their domain username and password.

---

## Authorization

Authorization answers:

> **What are you allowed to access?**

Example:

A user successfully logs into Windows but cannot access the Finance shared folder.

The user is authenticated but may not be authorized to access the resource.

---

# 🏢 OU vs Security Group vs GPO

One of the most important concept separations:

```text
OU
↓
Organization / Management

Security Group
↓
Access / Permissions

GPO
↓
Configuration / Security Settings
```

### Memory Trick

> **OU = WHERE**
> **Security Group = WHO gets ACCESS**
> **GPO = WHAT SETTINGS**

